      "comment": "RUN BINDI RUN (1) was a solid 18.84 winner of a Grade 5 at this track last start. Has the ability and looks a key chance again. PIGEON'S DESIRE (6) goes very well this course and distance starting 90 times for 32 wins and 35 minors. Missed the frame latest (18.92) when fourth over 330m at this track in a Free For All. Among the main chances. FENELLA (8) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish 2 lengths away in second (19.00) behind Roar Of Thunder at this track. Expected to be in this for a long way. WHAT EVER (4) is always hard to beat when she races here at this trip.",
